# 🎬 Top 5 Events in Train to Busan

### 1. 🧟 The Zombie Outbreak

A mysterious infection begins spreading across South Korea, turning people into violent zombies.

### 2. 🚆 The Train Journey Begins

Seok-woo and his daughter Su-an board the train from Seoul to Busan, unaware of the danger that is about to unfold.

### 3. 🧟‍♂️ The Infection Reaches the Train

An infected passenger gets onto the train, and the infection quickly spreads among passengers, turning the train into a fight for survival.

### 4. 💪 The Fight for Survival

Seok-woo, Sang-hwa, and other survivors work together to move through the train and protect their loved ones while escaping the infected passengers.

### 5. ❤️ The Final Sacrifice

Near the end of the journey, Seok-woo makes a heartbreaking sacrifice to protect Su-an, showing the power of a father's love and selflessness.
